WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh,
and welcome to JTK Academy.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
My name is Musa. I'm the founder.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.000
I converted to Islam and studied Arabic in Al Madinah,
the city of the Prophet, sallallahu alayhi wa sallam.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
And now I help Muslims learn the Qur'an and Arabic
through one-to-one lessons online.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A lot of people spend months using apps but still struggle
to actually read and understand the Arabic language.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
At JTK, you get a real teacher, personalised one-to-one
lessons and a structured approach based on your level.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
We start with a free trial lesson so we can understand
where you are and help you work towards your goals.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.600
If you're ready to start learning Arabic, fill in the form
and book your free trial lesson today.
